<h3>Day 12: Presenting Our Climate Action Projects</h3>

<p>
Day 12 marked the culmination of everything we had been working toward over the past two weeks. We spent the morning packing before giving our final Climate Action Project presentations. Each presentation was four minutes long and followed by a Q&amp;A session. I was asked several questions about my project, and it was rewarding to see people genuinely interested in the work I had put into it.
</p>

<p>
Afterward, we displayed our posters around the room for a poster session, where everyone had the opportunity to walk around, learn about each other's projects, and ask questions. It was inspiring to see the variety of ideas people developed and the different ways each project approached climate action.
</p>

